"MERGE (e:Article {id: \"Article_4455676\", title: \"Advances in Knowledge Discovery and Management\", abstract: \"This book comprises a distinguished collection of cutting-edge scientific contributions . Encompassing a wide range of subjects , This book delves into machine learning , data mining , text analysis , data visualization , knowledge management , and more . The included articles are expanded versions of carefully selected top papers that were originally presented at the EGC\u20192020 conferences held in Paris ( France , January 27-31 , 2020 ) . This book is intended for researchers interested in machine learning , data mining , text analysis , data visualization , knowledge management , and more , including PhD and MSc students , and researchers from public or private laboratories . expanded versions of carefully selected top papers that were originally presented at the EGC\u20192020 conferences held in Paris ( France , January 27-31 , 2020 ) underwent an additional peer-review process , building upon the already accepted long-format papers from the EGC\u20192020 conferences held in Paris ( France , January 27-31 , 2020 ) . The selection of long and short papers for the EGC\u20192020 conferences held in Paris ( France , January 27-31 , 2020 ) followed a rigorous double-blind peer-review process , evaluating numerous submissions ( with a long paper acceptance rate of approximately 25 % ) . For more details about the EGC society , please consult egc.asso.fr .\", labels: [\"Industrial Digitalization\", \"Digital Engineering of Products and Processes\", \"Industrial Organization Performance\"], teams: [\"LS2N-DUKE\"]});"
