"MERGE (e:Article {id: \"Article_3677117\", title: \"Feasibility of combining transcranial direct current stimulation and active fully embodied virtual reality for visual height intolerance : a double-blind randomized controlled study\", abstract: \"Background : Transcranial Direct Current Stimulation ( tDCS ) and Virtual Reality Exposure Therapy ( VRET ) are individually increasingly used in psychiatric research . Objective / Hypothesis : Our study aimed to investigate the feasibility of combining tDCS and wireless 360 \u00b0 full immersive active and embodied VRET to reduce height-induced anxiety . Methods : Our carried out a pilot randomized , double-blind , controlled study associating Virtual Reality Exposure Therapy ( VRET ) with tDCS in 28 participants . The primary outcomes were the sense of presence level and the tolerability . The secondary outcomes were the anxiety level ( Subjective Unit of Discomfort ) and the salivary cortisol concentration . Results : Our confirmed the feasibility of the association between tDCS and Virtual Reality Exposure Therapy ( VRET associated with a good sense of presence without noticeable adverse effects . In both groups , a significant reduction in the fear of height was observed after two sessions , with only a small effect size of add-on tDCS ( 0.1 ) according to the SUD . The variations of cortisol concentration differed in the tDCS and sham groups . Conclusion : Our study confirmed the feasibility of the association between tDCS and Virtual Reality Exposure Therapy ( VRET . The optimal tDCS paradigm remains to be determined in this context to increase effect size and then adequately power future clinical studies assessing synergies between Transcranial Direct Current Stimulation ( tDCS ) and Virtual Reality Exposure Therapy ( VRET ) .\", labels: [], teams: [\"LS2N-DUKE\"]});"
"MATCH (s:Entity { id: \"Entity_virtual_reality_exposure_therapy\" }) MATCH (o:Article { id: \"Article_3677117\" }) MERGE (s)-[:APPEARS_IN]->(o);"
"MERGE (e:Entity {id: \"Entity_tdcs\", name: \"tdcs\"});"
