"MERGE (e:Article {id: \"Article_5052435\", title: \"Multi-Label kNN classifier with Online Dual Memory on data stream\", abstract: \"Due to an ever-increasing demand for analyzing the large volumes of information issuing from high-speed data streams , multi-label stream classification is replacing the traditional offline multi-label classification system and has thus become a focal point in recent years . In this paper , we propose a new algorithm for multi-label stream classification that relies on an Online Dual Memory ( ODM ) . a new algorithm for multi-label stream classification that relies on an Online Dual Memory ( ODM ) uses a short-term memory in order to adapt quickly to changes within the data stream , and employs a long-term memory for recurring concepts . Furthermore , via a modification of Learning Vector Quantization , a new algorithm for multi-label stream classification that relies on an Online Dual Memory ( ODM ) is not only capable of classifying efficiently but also of maintaining a low computational complexity . Experiments were conducted so as to establish a comprehensive overview of a new algorithm for multi-label stream classification that relies on an Online Dual Memory ( ODM ) performance , which was achieved by comparing four methods on two different kinds of datasets ( nine stationary datasets and four datasets with concept drift ) . we results confirm the high accuracy and low time complexity of a new algorithm for multi-label stream classification that relies on an Online Dual Memory ( ODM ) , as well as a new algorithm for multi-label stream classification that relies on an Online Dual Memory ( ODM ) ability to cope with concept drift .\", labels: [\"Industrial Digitalization\"], teams: [\"LS2N-DUKE\"]});"
"MATCH (s:Entity { id: \"Entity_multi_label_stream_classification\" }) MATCH (o:Article { id: \"Article_5052435\" }) MERGE (s)-[:APPEARS_IN]->(o);"
"MERGE (e:Entity {id: \"Entity_offline_multi_label_classification_system\", name: \"offline_multi_label_classification_system\"});"
