"MERGE (e:Article {id: \"Article_2318580\", title: \"Observing Learner Engagement on Mind Mapping Activities Using Learning Analytics\", abstract: \"Research on learner engagement has increased in recent years arguing that learner engagement favors academic success . Teachers want Teachers learners to engage in meaningful learning activities , like mind mapping , but Teachers lack clues for observing their learners engagement along meaningful learning activities , like mind mapping . In this paper , we propose indicators of behavioural and cognitive dimensions of learner engagement for mind mapping activities based on interaction traces . indicators of behavioural and cognitive dimensions of learner engagement for mind mapping activities have been defined from final mind maps as well as from the mind mapping processes . we discuss implications for the observation of learner engagement in learning activities similar to mind mapping .\", labels: [\"Preparation for New Jobs in the Future Industry\"], teams: [\"LS2N-DUKE\"]});"
