"MERGE (e:Article {id: \"Article_2441374\", title: \"A review on dimensionality reduction for multi-label classification\", abstract: \"Multi-label classification has gained in importance in the last decade and Multi-label classification is today confronted to the current needs to process massive raw data from heterogeneous sources . Therefore , dimensionality reduction , which aims at reducing the number of features , labels , or both , knows a renewed interest to enhance the scaling properties of the classifiers and the classifiers predictive performances . In this paper we review more than fifty papers presenting dimensionality reduction approaches for multi-label classification and we propose an analysis in three steps : ( i ) a typology of the methods describing the main components of the methods strategies , the problem the methods tackle and the way the methods solve the problem they tackle ( ii ) a unified formalization of the problem they tackle to help to distinguish the similarities and differences between the approaches , and ( iii ) a meta-analysis of the published experimental results inspired by the consensus theory to identify the most efficient algorithms .\", labels: [], teams: [\"LS2N-DUKE\"]});"
"MATCH (s:Entity { id: \"Entity_dimensionality_reduction\" }) MATCH (o:Article { id: \"Article_2441374\" }) MERGE (s)-[:APPEARS_IN]->(o);"
"MERGE (e:Entity {id: \"Entity_features\", name: \"features\"});"
