"MERGE (e:Article {id: \"Article_1631306\", title: \"Towards HMD-based Immersive Analytics\", abstract: \"Advances in 3D hardware and software have led to increasingly cheaper and simple-to-use immersive virtual reality systems that can provide real-time interactive 3D data representation . The immersive analytics field is developing as the newest avatar of 3D visual analyt-ics , which may relaunch the long enduring 2D vs 3D visualization debate . However , the terms of the long enduring 2D vs 3D visualization debate have changed : leveraging 3D human perception within virtual environments is now easier , and the immersive quality of today \u2019s rendering is sufficient enough for researchers to concentrate on testing and designing immersive data representation and interaction rather than on technological problems . In this position paper we propose a short historical perspective on the use of immersive technologies for visual analytics and on the long enduring 2D vs 3D visualization debate . we stress out five principles that we think should be followed to explore the HMD-based visual analytics design space , before introducing ongoing work within the IDEA project .\", labels: [\"Industrial Digitalization\", \"Digital Engineering of Products and Processes\", \"User-Centered Design\", \"Augmentation of Human Capabilities in Manufacturing\"], teams: [\"LS2N-DUKE\"]});"
"MATCH (s:Entity { id: \"Entity_d_hardware\" }) MATCH (o:Article { id: \"Article_1631306\" }) MERGE (s)-[:APPEARS_IN]->(o);"
"MERGE (e:Entity {id: \"Entity_immersive_virtual_reality_systems\", name: \"immersive_virtual_reality_systems\"});"
