"MERGE (e:Article {id: \"Article_1631926\", title: \"Dashboard for monitoring student engagement in mind mapping activities\", abstract: \"Our work aims at helping teachers to monitor learners ' engagement during mind mapping activities . The use of mind maps helps students to elaborate cognitive learning strategies like creating and organizing contents . To assess the quality of mind maps , teachers need tools to understand students ' choices and strategies when constructing teachers mind maps . Our have defined in collaboration with teachers a set of indicators based on learners ' interaction traces . a set of indicators based on learners ' interaction traces have been implemented and integrated in a dashboard dedicated to teachers . In this paper , Our introduce a first version of a dashboard dedicated to teachers : a dashboard dedicated to teachers design , implementation , and the results of a dashboard dedicated to teachers evaluation conducted during interviews with real teachers .\", labels: [\"Monitoring and Analysis\", \"Industrial Digitalization\", \"Preparation for New Jobs in the Future Industry\", \"User-Centered Design\"], teams: [\"LS2N-DUKE\"]});"
